  "description": "Erection of two-storey side extension to ground floor shop and first floor to create 2 bedroom first floor flat. Demolition of existing rear WC and erection of single storey rear extension and garden area to first floor flat and erection of a new fence, formation of parking area to rear, erection of handrail to shop front and installation of windows to existing building and installation of vehicular crossover onto Park Road.",
