  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - .",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 5 - Details of Pile & Beam foundations to be used in the extensions must be \r\nsubmitted and approved in writing by the Council prior to commencement on site and then built in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 6 - The roof area of the single storey rear extension hereby permitted shall not be used as a balcony, roof garden or similar amenity area without the grant of further specific permission from the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 08.00 to 18.00 on Mondays to Friday and 08.00 to 13.00 on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - The use hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of the arrangements for storing of waste and recycled materials have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The arrangements for storing waste and recycled materials shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be installed and completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied.",
    "Condition : 9 - The car parking area shown on drawing No.106b Received 26.08.05 shall be provided within three months of commencement of construction works for the  extensions hereby permitted and thereafter it shall not be used for any purpose other than the parking of vehicles.",
    "Condition : 10 - Details the proposed rear roof extension, including valley detail, gutters, \r\ntiling, rooflight fitting and ridge details must be submitted and approved in writing by the Council prior to commencement of construction on site.",
    "Condition : 11 - No development shall take place until there has been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority a plan indicating the positions, design, materials and type of boundary treatment to be erected.  The boundary treatment shall be completed before the before the building is occupied or in accordance with a timetable agreed in writing with the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details."
